The AutoGPT template consists of three parts:
1.`Role`: name of the role
2.`Introduction`: including Author, Version, Language, and Description
3.`Goals`: Overall objectives based on the mandate

A prompt can be defined and configured using the three parts defined above.

To use this AutoGPT template

1. Set the role name: Replace `Your_Role_Name` after the `# Role` with the role name you want.
2. Write down the role's mission objectives in the `## Goals' section.

Follow the AutoGPT template above to create a role template for users in English. \
